      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"section-4-classifier-registry-and-results\">Section 4 \u2014 Classifier registry and results</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">New classifiers plug in through one dictionary (<code>CLASSIFIERS</code> below):\nadd an entry and it appears in the Section 0 multiselect flow, the ML\nloop, the tables and the plots with no other edits.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RandomForest</strong>: 500 trees, train-count class weights; <code>tuned</code> config\n  from a small <code>average_precision</code> grid search.</li>\n<li><strong>XGBoost</strong>: <code>hist</code> on CUDA with CPU fallback, <code>scale_pos_weight</code>\n  from train counts; <code>tuned</code> config from a small grid.</li>\n<li><strong>TabFM</strong>: zero-shot foundation model (<code>standard</code> and <code>ensemble</code>).\n  Needs a Hugging Face token (env <code>HF_TOKEN</code>, the input below, or the\n  cached token file) and loads on CUDA when available. <code>torch</code> and\n  <code>tabfm</code> install automatically on first load only.</li>\n<li>The GSMOTE toggle from Section 0 applies inside every training fold.</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Read spatial-block CV first (honest). Holdout rows are shown only as a\nleakage-ceiling reference.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
